Package: SyntheticData
Title: Synthetic Counterparts of Proprietary Tabular Databases
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Marton", "Kiss", , "mrkmarton@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns de-identified clinical tables (Excel/CSV) into
    synthetic counterparts by rolling censor-and-impute: every
    non-identifier cell, missingness included, is censored once and
    re-drawn from a CART donor model fitted on the rest of the table.
    Identifiers are kept so tables stay joinable.
